<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#171a1f" />
    <meta name="description" content="华山医院、瑞金医院消化内科与神经内科专家号源总览及放号提醒。" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/officialwebsite/favicon.png" />
    <title>挂号｜专家号源总览</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&amp;family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --shell: #171a1f;
        --shell-soft: #1e2229;
        --paper: #f4f3ee;
        --paper-strong: #ffffff;
        --ink: #171a1f;
        --ink-soft: #60646b;
        --line: #deddd7;
        --line-dark: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
        --available: #0d8f6c;
        --available-bg: #dff5ec;
        --waiting: #0d7d96;
        --waiting-bg: #dceff4;
        --full: #85878b;
        --full-bg: #e9e9e6;
        --accent: #ff5b72;
        --blue: #8297ff;
        --font: "Manrope", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100%; background: var(--shell); }
      body { min-width: 320px; min-height: 100svh; margin: 0; background: var(--shell); color: #f4f5f7; font-family: var(--font); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; }
      button, input, select { font: inherit; }
      button, a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      [hidden] { display: none !important; }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 44px));
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 18px 0;
      }
      .brand, .back-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
      .brand { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
      .brand svg { width: 31px; height: 31px; }
      .back-link { color: #a9adb5; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
      .back-link:hover { color: #fff; }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 44px));
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 32px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(54px, 8vw, 106px) 0 34px;
      }
      .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 13px; color: #8ea0ff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em; }
      h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(46px, 7vw, 82px); letter-spacing: -0.065em; line-height: 0.94; }
      .hero p:last-child { max-width: 680px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: #aeb2ba; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; }
      .connection {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 9px 13px;
        color: #b8bcc3;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .connection-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6c7077; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(108, 112, 119, 0.12); }
      .connection.is-connected .connection-dot { background: #32c998; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(50, 201, 152, 0.13); }

      .workspace { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
      .workspace-inner { width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 44px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 0 72px; }
      .setup-panel {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        border: 1px solid #d7d5ce;
        border-radius: 17px;
        padding: 20px 22px;
        background: #ebeae5;
      }
      .setup-panel h2 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      .setup-panel p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .installation-help { margin-top: 10px; color: #555a61; font-size: 10px; }
      .installation-help summary { width: fit-content; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; }
      .installation-help ol { margin: 9px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; line-height: 1.8; }
      .setup-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 40px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .button--dark { background: #1f2329; color: #fff; }
      .button--outline { border-color: #c8c7c0; background: transparent; color: #2c3036; }
      .button--accent { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
      .button:focus-visible, .segmented button:focus-visible, .slot:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgba(96, 122, 255, 0.25); outline-offset: 2px; }

      .control-deck {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .filter-stack { display: flex; min-width: 0; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
      .segmented { display: inline-flex; padding: 3px; border: 1px solid #d6d5cf; border-radius: 11px; background: #ebeae5; }
      .segmented button { min-height: 34px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0 13px; background: transparent; color: #696d73; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
      .segmented button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(30, 33, 38, 0.08); color: #171a1f; }
      .control-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
      .only-available { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #666a70; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
      .only-available input { width: 17px; height: 17px; accent-color: var(--available); }

      .board { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #d7d6d0; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--paper-strong); box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(30, 34, 42, 0.08); }
      .board-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 17px 20px; }
      .board-title h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
      .board-title p { margin: 0; color: #7e8187; font-size: 10px; }
      .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 13px; color: #6b6e73; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }
      .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
      .legend i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 3px; }
      .legend .available { background: var(--available); }
      .legend .waiting { background: var(--waiting); }
      .legend .full { background: #a7a8a7; }
      .legend .none { border: 1px solid #c9c9c4; background: transparent; }

      .empty-state { display: grid; min-height: 390px; place-items: center; padding: 54px 24px; text-align: center; }
      .empty-mark { display: grid; width: 62px; height: 62px; place-items: center; margin: 0 auto 18px; border: 1px solid #d9d8d2; border-radius: 18px; background: #f4f3ef; }
      .empty-mark svg { width: 30px; fill: none; stroke: #5b6068; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-width: 1.7; }
      .empty-state h3 { margin: 0 0 9px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
      .empty-state p { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 20px; color: #777b82; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }

      .matrix-scroll { overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior-inline: contain; }
      .matrix { width: max-content; min-width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; font-size: 11px; }
      .matrix th, .matrix td { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .matrix th:last-child, .matrix td:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      .matrix tbody tr:last-child td, .matrix tbody tr:last-child th { border-bottom: 0; }
      .matrix thead th { position: sticky; z-index: 3; top: 0; min-width: 104px; padding: 12px 8px; background: #f4f3ef; color: #4f535a; text-align: center; }
      .matrix thead th:first-child { z-index: 5; left: 0; min-width: 224px; text-align: left; }
      .matrix-date { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: #8c8f94; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; }
      .doctor-cell { position: sticky; z-index: 2; left: 0; width: 224px; min-width: 224px; padding: 14px 15px; background: #fff; text-align: left; }
      .doctor-name { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 13px; }
      .doctor-title { display: block; overflow: hidden; max-width: 190px; color: #8a8d92; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
      .slot-cell { min-width: 104px; padding: 6px; vertical-align: top; }
      .slot-stack { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
      .slot {
        display: grid;
        min-height: 34px;
        grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr;
        align-items: center;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 4px 7px;
        cursor: default;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .slot small { opacity: 0.72; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
      .slot strong { overflow: hidden; font-size: 9px; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
      .slot--available { background: var(--available-bg); color: #087255; }
      .slot--waiting { background: var(--waiting-bg); color: #08687c; }
      .slot--full { background: var(--full-bg); color: #77797d; }
      .slot--none { border: 1px dashed #deded9; background: transparent; color: #b2b2ae; }
      .matrix-note { padding: 12px 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: #faf9f6; color: #777b81; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.65; }

      .reminders { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 36px; padding: 48px 0 0; }
      .section-label p { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #878a90; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
      .section-label h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
      .reminder-panel { border-top: 1px solid #d5d4ce; }
      .reminder-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 18px 0; }
      .reminder-toolbar p { margin: 0; color: #74777d; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .reminder-list { display: grid; gap: 9px; }
      .reminder-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 16px; border: 1px solid #d8d7d1; border-radius: 13px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fff; }
      .reminder-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
      .reminder-card span { color: #777b81; font-size: 10px; }
      .reminder-card button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #8b8e94; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }
      .reminder-empty { border: 1px dashed #d4d3cd; border-radius: 13px; padding: 18px; color: #85888e; font-size: 11px; }

      dialog { width: min(520px, calc(100% - 28px)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); border-radius: 20px; padding: 0; background: #23272e; color: #f5f5f4; box-shadow: 0 32px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); }
      dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(9, 11, 14, 0.68); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
      .dialog-head { display: flex; align-items: start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; padding: 22px 22px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
      .dialog-head h2 { margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 19px; }
      .dialog-head p { margin: 0; color: #9da2aa; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .dialog-close { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #aeb2b8; cursor: pointer; font-size: 20px; }
      .reminder-form { display: grid; gap: 15px; padding: 20px 22px 22px; }
      .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
      label { display: grid; gap: 7px; color: #b6bac1; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
      input, select { min-height: 42px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); border-radius: 10px; padding: 0 11px; background: #191c21; color: #fff; }
      .dialog-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 9px; margin-top: 3px; }
      dialog .button--outline { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58); color: #f3f4f5; }

      .source-footer { width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 44px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0 34px; color: #8d9199; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .source-footer a { color: #c5c8ce; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

      @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .topbar, .hero, .workspace-inner, .source-footer { width: min(100% - 28px, 680px); }
        .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 46px; }
        .connection { width: fit-content; }
        .setup-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; }
        .setup-actions { flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .control-deck { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
        .filter-stack { overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 2px; }
        .control-actions { justify-content: space-between; }
        .board-head { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
        .legend { justify-content: flex-start; }
        .reminders { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
        .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .brand span { display: none; }
        .hero { padding-bottom: 25px; }
        .workspace-inner { padding-top: 18px; }
        .setup-actions .button { flex: 1; }
        .segmented button { padding: 0 10px; }
        .control-actions { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
        .button { width: 100%; }
        .matrix thead th:first-child, .doctor-cell { width: 162px; min-width: 162px; }
        .doctor-title { max-width: 132px; }
        .reminder-toolbar { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="topbar" aria-label="页面导航">
      <a class="brand" href="/officialwebsite/">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="brand-gradient" x1="0.12" y1="0.98" x2="0.85" y2="0.08"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#6887ff"/><stop offset="0.34" stop-color="#a961ff"/><stop offset="0.61" stop-color="#ff3868"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ff7200"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="url(#brand-gradient)" d="M0 64V22C0 9.85 9.85 0 22 0s22 9.85 22 22v3h2c9.94 0 18 8.06 18 18s-8.06 18-18 18H21.5C13.9 61 6.56 62.04 0 64Z"/></svg>
        <span>J先生的个人空间</span>
      </a>
      <a class="back-link" href="/officialwebsite/tools/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 实用工具</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">APPOINTMENT BOARD · 真实号源</p>
        <h1>挂号</h1>
        <p>把华山医院、瑞金医院消化内科与神经内科的专家排班摊开来看。每位医生、每个日期、上午与下午，不再逐个点进详情页。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="connection" data-extension-status><span class="connection-dot"></span><span data-extension-label>扩展未连接</span></div>
    </header>

    <main class="workspace">
      <div class="workspace-inner">
        <section class="setup-panel" data-setup-panel aria-labelledby="setup-title">
          <div>
            <h2 id="setup-title">真实号源由官方页面安全同步</h2>
            <p>安装配套扩展后，在申康官方网页端登录并打开目标科室。扩展只保存医生、日期、时段与余号状态；手机号、验证码和就诊人信息始终留在官方页面。</p>
            <details class="installation-help"><summary>第一次安装怎么做？</summary><ol><li>下载并解压扩展包。</li><li>打开 chrome://extensions，开启“开发者模式”。</li><li>点击“加载已解压的扩展程序”，选择解压后的文件夹。</li><li>回到本页，看到“扩展已连接”后开始同步。</li></ol></details>
          </div>
          <div class="setup-actions">
            <a class="button button--dark" href="/officialwebsite/downloads/magicj-appointment-companion.zip" download>下载 Chrome 扩展</a>
            <a class="button button--outline" href="https://internethospital.shdc.org.cn/yilian-cloud-v2.0-web/src/login/login.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开官方登录页 ↗</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="control-deck">
          <div class="filter-stack">
            <div class="segmented" aria-label="选择医院" data-hospital-filter>
              <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-hospital="42500653900">华山医院</button>
              <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-hospital="42502656400">瑞金医院</button>
            </div>
            <div class="segmented" aria-label="选择科室" data-department-filter>
              <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-department="digestive">消化内科</button>
              <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-department="neurology">神经内科</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="control-actions">
            <label class="only-available"><input type="checkbox" data-only-available /> 仅看有号/候补</label>
            <button class="button button--dark" type="button" data-sync-department>同步当前科室 ↗</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="board" aria-labelledby="board-title">
          <header class="board-head">
            <div class="board-title"><h2 id="board-title" data-board-title>华山医院 · 消化内科</h2><p data-snapshot-time>等待首次同步</p></div>
            <div class="legend" aria-label="号源状态图例">
              <span><i class="available"></i>可预约</span><span><i class="waiting"></i>可候补</span><span><i class="full"></i>约满</span><span><i class="none"></i>未排班</span>
            </div>
          </header>
          <div class="empty-state" data-empty-state>
            <div>
              <div class="empty-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="22" height="20" rx="4"/><path d="M10 4v6M22 4v6M5 13h22M11 20h10M16 15v10"/></svg></div>
              <h3>还没有这组真实号源</h3>
              <p>连接扩展后点击“同步当前科室”，在申康官方页面完成登录。号源出现时，这里会自动按医生与上午/下午排成一张表。</p>
              <button class="button button--accent" type="button" data-sync-empty>去官方页面同步</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="matrix-scroll" data-matrix-wrap hidden>
            <table class="matrix" data-matrix>
              <thead data-matrix-head></thead>
              <tbody data-matrix-body></tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="matrix-note">号源会随官方平台变化，以提交预约时的官方结果为准。“候补”仅在官方返回明确候补字段时显示，不做推测。</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="reminders" aria-labelledby="reminder-title">
          <div class="section-label"><p>RELEASE REMINDERS</p><h2 id="reminder-title">放号提醒</h2></div>
          <div class="reminder-panel">
            <div class="reminder-toolbar">
              <p>提醒时间由你设置；安装扩展后，即使关闭本页，Chrome 也会在指定时间通知。</p>
              <button class="button button--dark" type="button" data-add-reminder>＋ 设置提醒</button>
            </div>
            <div class="reminder-list" data-reminder-list><div class="reminder-empty">暂无提醒。建议设置在医院公布的放号时间前 5 分钟。</div></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="source-footer">
      数据来源：<a href="https://internethospital.shdc.org.cn/yilian-cloud-v2.0-web/src/shssdc/shenkangyilian.html?origin=shrelease&amp;type=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">上海申康医院发展中心预约平台</a>。华山医院官网说明其专家预约号源通常提供两周范围并于 18:00 更新，实际以平台为准；瑞金医院请按官方最新通知自行设定提醒。本站不代挂号、不提交预约，也不收集患者资料。
    </footer>

    <dialog data-reminder-dialog>
      <div class="dialog-head">
        <div><h2>设置放号提醒</h2><p>选择你想关注的医院、科室与时间。提醒不等于预约成功。</p></div>
        <button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭" data-dialog-close>×</button>
      </div>
      <form class="reminder-form" data-reminder-form>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <label>医院<select name="hospital"><option value="42500653900">华山医院</option><option value="42502656400">瑞金医院</option></select></label>
          <label>科室<select name="department"><option value="digestive">消化内科</option><option value="neurology">神经内科</option></select></label>
        </div>
        <label>提醒时间<input name="remindAt" type="datetime-local" required /></label>
        <div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button button--outline" type="button" data-dialog-cancel>取消</button><button class="button button--accent" type="submit">保存提醒</button></div>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <script src="../../scripts/appointment-dashboard.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>
